Let zipfile read zstd (ZIP method 93) too.

zipimport serves the .py modules, but every other resource (the bundled
pip wheel, the venv activate scripts, the pydoc CSS) is read through
zipfile, which importlib.resources sits on. Without this, 566 of the 618
members raised NotImplementedError and `python -m venv` failed because
ensurepip could not read its wheel. Writing method 93 stays unsupported.

--- a/Lib/zipfile/__init__.py
+++ b/Lib/zipfile/__init__.py
@@ -767,6 +767,62 @@
     98: 'ppmd',
